@startuml
[*] --> NotLoggedIn
NotLoggedIn --> LoggedIn : User logs in
LoggedIn --> TrackingHabits : Start tracking habits
TrackingHabits --> AnalyzingData : System analyzes data
TrackingHabits --> RequestingMoreData : System requests more data
AnalyzingData --> TrackingHabits : Provide insights and suggestions
AnalyzingData --> LoggingOut : User logs out
RequestingMoreData --> TrackingHabits : User provides more data
RequestingMoreData --> LoggingOut : User logs out
LoggingOut --> [*] : Logout completes
@enduml
